{"id":10459,"date":"2026-05-06T13:11:35","date_gmt":"2026-05-06T13:11:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10459"},"modified":"2026-05-06T13:12:54","modified_gmt":"2026-05-06T13:12:54","slug":"what-attracts-rats-to-melbourne-suburbs-and-how-7-states-pest-control-keeps-them-out","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-attracts-rats-to-melbourne-suburbs-and-how-7-states-pest-control-keeps-them-out\/","title":{"rendered":"What Attracts Rats to Melbourne Suburbs? And How 7 States Pest Control Keeps Them Out"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Have you ever been lying in bed, just about to fall asleep, and suddenly you hear it? A soft, fast scratching sound coming from inside the wall. Or maybe you walked into the kitchen to make a morning coffee and found tiny dark droppings in the corner of the pantry.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If this sounds familiar, you are definitely not alone.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding signs of mice or rats in your house is an awful feeling. It makes you feel dirty and unsafe in your own space. Right now, homes across the city are seeing a huge jump in pest activity. But before you can get rid of them, you need to understand why they are choosing your house in the first place. Once you know what draws them in, you can take steps to stop them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Today, we are going to look at the hidden reasons these pests love your home.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We will also explain why trying to fix it yourself rarely works, and why calling professional <\/span><b>rodent removal services in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the smartest way to protect your family and your property.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>4 Hidden Reasons Rats Are Drawn to Your Melbourne Home<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-10461\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.20.52-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"rodent pest control melbourne\" width=\"686\" height=\"457\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.20.52-PM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.20.52-PM-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.20.52-PM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.20.52-PM.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 686px) 100vw, 686px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rats and mice do not just pick a house by random chance. They are smart little survivors. They are always on the hunt for three basic things: food, water, and a safe shelter to raise their babies. Unfortunately, many homes offer all three without the owners even knowing it. Here are the top four reasons pests might be targeting your property.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>1. Dropping Temperatures and Changing Weather<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We all know that Melbourne&#8217;s weather is famous for changing quickly. It can be sunny one minute and freezing cold the next.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When the harsh winter winds hit or the heavy rains start pouring down, we all want to be inside where it is warm and dry. Rats and mice feel the exact same way.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They hate the cold and the wet. When the temperature drops, they start looking for a cozy place to build a nest.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your roof void, the space between your walls, and the area under your floorboards are perfect for them. These spots are safe from the wind and rain. They also capture the heat from your home heating system. This is why calls for <\/span><b>rodent pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> always go up as soon as the winter season begins.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>2. Easy Access to Pet Food and Rubbish Bins<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pests have an amazing sense of smell. They can smell food from a very long distance away. One of the biggest mistakes homeowners make is leaving food out in the open.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do you feed your dog or cat outside? Leaving pet food sitting in a bowl overnight is like setting up a free all-you-can-eat buffet for mice. They will come back every single night to eat the leftovers.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The same rule applies to your outdoor rubbish bins and compost heaps. If your bin bags are not tied tight, or if the lid on your green bin does not close properly, pests will smell the rotting food. They will climb up and grab a free meal. Once they know your yard is a great place to find food, they will naturally want to move into your house to be closer to the kitchen.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>3. Overgrown Gardens and Backyard Clutter<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before a rat moves into your warm roof, it usually sets up a base camp in your garden. They love places where they can hide from predators like cats, owls, and foxes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If your backyard has thick overgrown bushes, piles of old firewood, or piles of junk sitting against the fence, you are giving them the perfect hiding spots. Tall grass and thick weeds are like a safe highway for them to run around your yard without being seen.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If they feel safe living in your garden, it is only a matter of time before they find a way inside your house. Keep your grass cut short and move firewood away from the outside walls of your home.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>4. Gaps and Cracks in Older Homes<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many houses in our local suburbs are older builds. They have plenty of charm, but they also have plenty of gaps. Did you know that a mouse can squeeze its body through a hole the size of a standard pen?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0A fully grown rat only needs a gap the size of a 10-cent coin to get inside.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Over the years, the weather can cause the ground to shift. This creates tiny cracks in your brickwork. Vents on the outside of your house get broken.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weather stripping under your doors gets worn out. Gaps form around the pipes that go into your kitchen and bathroom. These tiny openings are open doors for pests. Without professional <\/span><b>rodent removal services in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to help spot these hidden entry points, you might never know how they are getting inside.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>The Hidden Dangers of a Rodent Infestation<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some people think that having a few mice on the roof is no big deal. They just ignore the scratching sounds and hope the problem goes away on its own. This is a very dangerous mistake. Pests do not leave once they get comfortable. They stay, they breed very fast, and they cause massive damage.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Fire Hazards and Property Damage:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A rat&#8217;s teeth never stop growing. To keep their teeth short and sharp, they have to chew on things constantly. Inside your walls, they will chew on timber framing, plastic water pipes, and worst of all, electrical wires. Chewing the plastic coating off your wires leaves raw electricity exposed. This is a massive fire hazard and causes many house fires every year. They also tear up your expensive roof insulation to make soft nests for their babies.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Serious Health Risks:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Pests are incredibly dirty. They walk through garbage and sewers before running across your kitchen benches. They leave hundreds of urine drops and droppings behind every single day.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This waste carries nasty bacteria and dangerous diseases like Salmonella. Breathing in the dust from dried droppings can also trigger asthma and allergies in children.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because the risks to your home and health are so high, waiting to fix the problem is a bad idea. This is why you need fast and effective <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\"><b>rodent pest control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> the moment you see the first warning sign.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How 7 States Pest Control Keeps Them Out for Good<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Going to the hardware store and buying a few cheap snap traps might catch one or two mice. But it will never solve the whole problem. You might kill the slow ones, but the smart ones will learn to avoid the traps. The nest will just keep growing behind your walls.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At<\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><b>7 States Pest Control,<\/b> <\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">we use a proven system to wipe out the whole colony and protect your home for the future.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Step 1: Deep Property Inspection<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-10460\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.22.12-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"rodent pest control melbourne\" width=\"852\" height=\"568\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.22.12-PM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.22.12-PM-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.22.12-PM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-02-at-1.22.12-PM.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We do not just guess where the pests are hiding. Our trained experts act like detectives. We search your property from top to bottom.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We look for tiny grease marks on the walls, fresh droppings, and hidden chew marks. By doing a full inspection, our <\/span><b>rodent removal services in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> team finds the main nest and figures out the exact paths they are using to travel through your house.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Step 2: Safe and Targeted Eradication<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once we know where they live, we set up professional-grade baiting stations. We do not use the weak stuff you buy at the supermarket.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our treatments are highly attractive to pests but completely locked away in strong, tamper-proof boxes. This means they are highly effective against the colony, but they stay completely safe around your children and your family pets. The pests eat the bait, take it back to the hidden nest, and the entire colony dies off. This is the true power of professional <\/span><b>rodent pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Step 3: Sealing the Entry Points\u00a0<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Killing the current rats is only half the job. If you leave the holes in your walls open, a new family of pests will just move in next month.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After we clear out the infestation, we work with you to point out the weak spots around your house. We give you clear advice on which gaps need to be filled, which vents need new wire mesh, and how to fix your doors so nothing else can crawl underneath.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Us for Rodent Pest Control in Melbourne?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you have pests running around in the dark, you want a team you can trust to fix it fast.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>7 States Pest Control <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">is a fully licensed, local business. We know the exact types of pests that bother our local suburbs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We pride ourselves on offering honest advice, transparent prices, and treatments that actually work. We treat your home with the same respect we would treat our own.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are a full-service pest management team, meaning whether you need to trap a family of rats or need safe, emergency <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wasp-removal-melbourne\/\"><b>melbourne wasp removal<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we have the tools and experience to handle it.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you hire us, you are getting peace of mind. You can finally sleep quietly without hearing any more scratching in the ceiling.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><b>How do I know if I have rats or mice on my roof?<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The most common signs are hearing scratching or running sounds at night when the house is quiet. You might also find small, dark droppings in your cupboards, notice a strong musky smell, or see chewed holes in your food packaging.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Are your rodent treatments safe for my dogs and cats?<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, absolutely. Safety is our number one priority. We use lockable, tamper-proof bait stations. Your pets cannot get inside them, but the pests can. We always place them in hidden areas where your pets do not normally go.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>How much do rodent removal services in Melbourne cost?<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The price depends on how big your house is and how severe the infestation has become. However, getting it sorted out early by a professional is always much cheaper than paying an electrician to rewire your chewed-up house! Give us a call for a clear and fair quote.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Melbourne will always have rats and mice.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The changing weather and busy suburbs mean they will always be looking for a new place to stay. But your home does not have to be their next meal ticket. By keeping your yard clean, sealing up your rubbish bins, and fixing the cracks around your house, you can make your property much less inviting.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If they have already made their way inside, do not panic and do not waste money on weak DIY traps. Let the experts take care of it quickly and safely.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don&#8217;t let pests take over your home and put your family at risk. Contact us today to book the most reliable <\/span><b>rodent pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> has to offer.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose expert<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"> <b>pest control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services for complete pest management. We specialize in<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider control services<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and fast<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider removal service<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Our team also provides<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/fox-pest-control-in-melbourne\/\"> <b>fox population control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and trusted<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/possum-pest-control\/\"> <b>possum removal service Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Protect your property with advanced<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and reliable<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite treatment Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Have you ever been lying in bed, just about to fall asleep, and suddenly you hear it? A soft, fast scratching sound coming from inside the wall. Or maybe you walked into the kitchen to make a morning coffee and found tiny dark droppings in the corner of the pantry. If this sounds familiar, you [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10465,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[21],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10459","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-rodent-pest-control"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>What Attracts Rats to Melbourne? | 7 States Pest Control<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wondering why mice love your home? Discover what attracts rats to Melbourne suburbs and how our expert rodent pest control Melbourne team keeps them out\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-attracts-rats-to-melbourne-suburbs-and-how-7-states-pest-control-keeps-them-out\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What Attracts Rats to Melbourne? | 7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wondering why mice love your home? Discover what attracts rats to Melbourne suburbs and how our expert rodent pest control Melbourne team keeps them out\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-attracts-rats-to-melbourne-suburbs-and-how-7-states-pest-control-keeps-them-out\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-05-06T13:11:35+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-05-06T13:12:54+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-3.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"